<title>NORWAY: Hydro Q1 pre-tax profits fall.</title>
<headline>Hydro Q1 pre-tax profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>			     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenue	  23,249	vs	  21,380</p>
<p> Operating result	    3,145	vs	   3,116</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		3,202	vs	   3,327</p>
<p> After-tax result	    1,540	vs	   1,868</p>
<p> EPS Q1 (crowns)		6.70	vs	    8.20</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian industrial conglomerate is Norsk Hydro ASA. Ten analysts polled by Reuters forecast that Hydro would post first-quarter pre-tax profits of about 2,860 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
